<!--
  Bafana@Law public sitemap.

  Only the public routes declared under MainLayout in src/routes/AppRoutes.jsx.
  The administrator portal is deliberately absent: those routes are behind
  authentication and are already disallowed in robots.txt.

  /blog/:slug is not listed. Posts are fetched from the API at runtime, so
  their URLs cannot be enumerated in a static file; /blog is the crawl entry
  point for them.

  No <lastmod>: a hand-maintained date goes stale silently, which is worse
  than omitting it.
-->
